VulkanPMap (pm::)

Progressive GPU photon mapping: diffuse GI, caustics, dielectric sphere,
compact photon grid, surface irradiance atlas and temporal reconstruction.
Direct area-light shadows trace per-pixel rays by default; the older
filtered surface-space shadow cache remains an optional faster mode.
Geometry-aware HDR output and first-hit positions are returned to the host.
Public API: pmap/pmap.hpp; shaders: shaders/.
The host owns VulkanWrapper, command buffers and presentation.
